Make the tooltip's offset from the pointer settable

gpui places an element's tooltip one pixel past the pointer, so the
pointer's arrow lands on the tooltip's corner and covers its first
letters. Give the app a setting for how far past the pointer the tooltip
goes, flipping before the pointer by the same distance at the window's
edges; it is one pixel until the app sets it.

